```{=html}
<div class="list sb-rows" style="margin-top:28px">
<% for (const it of items) { %>
<a class="sb-row" href="<%= it.external || it.path %>" <%= metadataAttrs(it) %>>
<span class="info"><span class="t"><%= it.title %></span><span class="src"><%= it.source %><% if (it.categories) { %> · <%= it.categories.join(', ') %><% } %></span></span>
<span class="m listing-date"><%= it.date %></span>
</a>
<% } %>
</div>
```
